That thing hurt Mercurimon.

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:43.660
Unforgivable. I'll defeat it!

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:45.770
Ikuto! That's impossible for you to do right now!

00:22:45.770 --> 00:22:47.300
I figured it out.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:51.130
It's not humans I should hate, but bad guys like Kurata!

